## Interface: 16001
## Title: Pathy
## Notes: Pick a quest giver or turn-in and be led there by a 3D arrow, with a copy of BV Addon Suite's guide window, along the route BV Addon Suite - Routing plans (walls, stairs, lifts, boats and zeppelins included). Uses Questie's WoW: Forever database for the places.
